    "detailed_description": "Buffy Stole your Sandwich is an arcade game about a puppet named Xivek who had his  <br />\r\nRich sandwich stolen by a giant steroid enhanced squirrel named Buffy. The goal is to <br />\r\nUnlock all the levels to get your sandwich back! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game you\u2019ll be confronting Buffy at an abandoned construction site that is three levels <br />\r\nLong. Buffy will try to retaliate by throwing barrels at you, so it is your job to make your way <br />\r\nExpectantly through the level, dodge barrels, and get your sandwich back from Buffy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne thing that adds to this difficulty is that  if you die on any of the levels, it will send you <br />\r\n6 frustration points higher back to the start of the game. To help with your sanity, there are only<br />\r\n3 levels in the game. (Not including secret levels...)",
